{
 "_about": [
  "Alchemy recipes for the Nine Lives offline server. The originals only lived on the official server.",
  "Rebuilt from the player-written 'Ninelives Wiki' on atwiki (https://w.atwiki.jp/nine_lives/pages/35.html,",
  "mostly written June-July 2016, client ~0.23), cross-checked against the 5 in-game 'Recipe:' item pictures,",
  "which match it exactly. Item names were mapped to the game's own item IDs (see ITEMS.md).",
  "Each recipe: a key item (top slot), materials (lower slots, any order), and a result. Counts default to 1.",
  "'vendors': [ids] limits a recipe to certain alchemists; leave it out and every alchemist knows it.",
  "'hidden': true hides a recipe until the player has the ingredients or has mixed it before.",
  "Known guesses: the wiki lists Tasty Fried Egg once though the game has two (630000061 is used);",
  "Dyadian II gives the Dyadian II box, like other crafted gear. Which recipes were secret is unknown."
 ],
